This pack contains text written for it. It does not redistribute third-party
source files, scripts, CSV data or binaries. Four third-party works
contributed ideas or short passages to that text. Each is listed below with
its owner, its license, the exact revision read, what was taken, and how
closely. The license text of each work is kept in LICENSES/.
This file records the works distilled in sprint P3; earlier credits stay in the
README, section Acknowledgments.

Terms used on the "Derivation" line:
  concept          only the idea was taken; the wording, structure and values
                   are the pack's own, and no run of eight or more consecutive
                   words matches the source, apart from package and product
                   names.
  adapted summary  facts, rules or data rows were condensed, reordered and
                   reworded; short phrases may coincide with the source.
  adapted excerpt  a short passage, heading or list structure follows the
                   source closely enough that attribution is a license duty.

